                    "SYIzs": {
                      "content": "• CICO Feature: Cash in/out at convenience stores using map SDK, barcode generation, Firebase remote config\n• Bank Statement: Calendar-based statement requests with Jetpack Compose, Kotlin Multiplatform\n• Profile Feature: Dynamic data-driven UI for account info, transaction limits, settings\n• Automation Testing: First person to replace manual testing in releases — increased stable ratio from 65% to 90%\n• Crashlytic Tracking: Built SDK tracking user behaviors, app state, activity/fragment lifecycle"
                    }
                  }
                },
